header: "---\nname: jake-linkedin-li-comment\ndescription: \"Write comments on other people's LinkedIn posts that read as a person with an opinion, not a bot. Use when the user pastes a post and wants a comment, says \\\"comment on this\\\", \\\"engage with this\\\", \\\"what do I say here\\\", or wants a batch of comments for their engagement round.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/linkedin-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: li-comment\n  upstream_commit: add2c23882fe79180737d242ff80a5da205eda6a\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
